skill-data/core/references/authentication.md:221:agent-browser auth login my-app --credential-provider vault --item "My App" --no-navigate --url https://identity.example.com/login
skill-data/core/references/authentication.md:233:Use `--url`, `--username-selector`, `--password-selector`, and `--submit-selector` on `auth login` to override plugin-provided metadata for the current login only.
